WEBVTT

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.553
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Cappuccino, please.

00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:17.990
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:00:24.048 --> 00:00:24.795
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Helen.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:32.283
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Ellen?

00:00:38.752 --> 00:00:39.892
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> No, Helen.

00:00:46.403 --> 00:00:47.990
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Helen. OK.

00:01:02.063 --> 00:01:03.123
<v><b>Barista 2:</b></v> Are you Diana?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.151
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> No, I’m not.

00:01:17.164 --> 00:01:18.015
I’m Helen.

00:01:24.585 --> 00:01:30.103
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Sorry. Helen.

00:01:37.104 --> 00:01:38.160
Your cappuccino.

00:01:44.398 --> 00:01:45.125
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Thanks.

00:02:02.228 --> 00:02:03.015
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Hello.

00:02:09.226 --> 00:02:10.210
Are you Helen?

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.606
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Yes, I am.

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:24.993
And you’re Tom.

00:02:30.821 --> 00:02:33.063
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Yes! Nice to meet you.

00:02:38.887 --> 00:02:40.427
<v><b>Helen:</b></v> Nice to meet you.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:47.665
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Just a minute.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:03.732
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Hi. A tea, please.

00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:11.807
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:19.061
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> Tom.

00:03:25.585 --> 00:03:26.965
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Dom.

00:03:32.789 --> 00:03:35.273
<v><b>Tom:</b></v> No, I’m Tom, not Dom.

00:03:41.582 --> 00:03:43.342
<v><b>Barista 1:</b></v> Sorry.